{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523298-favorite-5th-edition-npcs","id":1523298,"title":"Favorite 5th Edition NPCs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-29T00:21:43-07:00","id":1523298,"title":"Favorite 5th Edition NPCs","content":"What separates V:TM from other games is the NPCs that are so vividly realized and major players in the story. It is a SOCIAL game and what really is the bread and butter is not the combat or Disciplines but how you interact with them.<br /> <br /> Each edition has its own most famous and beloved characters:<br /> <br /> 1st Edition: Lodin, Modius, Allicia, Evelyn, Damien, and Balthazar.<br /> <br /> Revised: Jan Pieterszoon, Theo Bell, Lucita, Beckett<br /> <br /> But 5th Edition?<br /> <br /> Who are the favorites of 5th Edition? There's a lot less focus on these this time around. So, this is a thread about sharing the ones that really resonated with you. You can choose them from the visual novels, video games, Web Shows (LA By Night), or Onyx Path's many supplements.<br /> <br /> You can even cheat and say, &quot;Who did I like the update for most?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T00:29:21-07:00","id":1523299,"title":"","content":"My top:<br /> 1. Euan Dunsirn - perfect oponent for WtA and VtS.<br /> 2. Sierra - Chicago Lasombra - clever NPC<br /> 3. Khadija and Aisha - something fresh for me with vibe of unknown danger<br /> 4. Nathanael Bordruff - fire and brimstone","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1784-werewolf43","name":"werewolf43","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1784_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"315"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T01:49:52-07:00","id":1523301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>werewolf43</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523298-favorite-5th-edition-npcs?p=1523299#post1523299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My top:<br /> 1. Euan Dunsirn - perfect oponent for WtA and VtS.<br /> 2. Sierra - Chicago Lasombra - clever NPC<br /> 3. Khadija and Aisha - something fresh for me with vibe of unknown danger<br /> 4. Nathanael Bordruff - fire and brimstone</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure Bordruff is from 1e Chicago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T07:55:46-07:00","id":1523306,"title":"","content":"Ok, i kind of felt bad about poking on someone else's list while adding nothing myself, so here goes one of my own:<br /> <br /> 1. <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Erzulie_(VTM)\" target=\"_blank\">Erzulie</a> - because she's a wonderful melange of themes both fresh to new players and resonant to older ones, imho. Plus, she's a walking crossroads of hooks and winks to multiple editions.<br /> <br /> 2. <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Galeb_Bazory\" target=\"_blank\">Galeb Bazory</a> - ok, that may be cheating from my part, but Galeb caught my interest because, fanbase outrage about the Beckoning, 2nd Inquisition &amp; stuff aside, he's very damn much a 1st ed elder. He might be no Khalid or Tyler, but could fit in all too well alongside Annabelle or Tyrus or a bunch of others in Chicago or Milwaukee for example. Great showing of how while the setting changed, some things can still be very much the same lore notwithstanding.<br /> <br /> 3. <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Noah_Grewal\" target=\"_blank\">Flyboy</a> - as both &quot;thin-blood gone legit&quot; and 2nd Inquisition infiltrator possibly going double/triple agent, Tyler's &quot;sucessor&quot; as master of O'Hare Airport has just the right mix of anti-establishment and sellout for the job. Also a pretty solid reminder that neonates can be people with decades of experience in cutthroat worlds of politics, business, crime or espionage.<br /> <br /> 4. <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Nazeera\" target=\"_blank\">Nazeera</a> - the poor thing is a veritable metaplot lightning rod and how it can't catch a break is both tragic and hilarious. Another minor tragicomic bit that attracted my attention to the NPC is Nazeera's apparent shock/outrage at Carna's destruction of Victor - who's a thuggish macho ex-black ops Tremere that i can't see anyone caring about <i>unless</i> romantically engaged, what would make Nazzera-Victor into the most oddball stealth pairing i've seen in a long time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> 5. <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Aila\" target=\"_blank\">Aila</a> - the idea of a centuries-old assamite warrior becoming one of the first female fighter pilots during the two world wars just appeals to me from a imagery perspective, even if we only get to know her through memories and flashbacks in <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire:_The_Masquerade_-_Night_Road\" target=\"_blank\">the source material</a>.<br /> <br /> <br /> Ah, an honorable mention of sorts goes to <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Winter%27s_Teeth_No._1\" target=\"_blank\">the Winter's Teeth cast</a>, as i adapted elements of the series and its sequel into my own globe-trotting V20 chronicle - though in quite different format, since <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Samantha_Merrain\" target=\"_blank\">Merrain</a> is still very much in the throne and the &quot;Dirty Boot&quot; is a team of not just <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cecily_Bain\" target=\"_blank\">Cecily</a> but the whole gang (among other things).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-08-2026, 07:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T11:52:23-07:00","id":1523315,"title":"","content":"Silvester De Ruiz: I like the fact that this Lasombra elder started from a humble background who's skill at spying gained the attention of the clan and was a favorite of there to watch and decided that whichever faction got to him first could embrace him or take him out when his days of being a field agent was over.<br /> <br /> Hesha Rudzhe: An elder from the Followers Of Set clan that wasn't a bad trope and came across as intelligent, charming, and very fleshed out as an indie that wanted to learn the origins of his kind and was friendly to most kindred and didn't look down on them for not being members of his clan.<br /> <br /> Prince Kevin Jackson: I like the idea of a older low generation neonate being smart, skilled and pragmatic enough to gain control of a major city and being able to convince much older and more powerful vampires to go along with his plans. It's a nice change from an Elder or ancient being the top dog in charge that we usually get.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 09-30-2023, 04:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T18:33:33-07:00","id":1523332,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I do think modern industry, finance, and government systems open the door for a meritocracy of relatively young princes whereas before extreme age and the connections that came with would have been an insurmountable advantage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T22:18:50-07:00","id":1523339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523298-favorite-5th-edition-npcs?p=1523332#post1523332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I do think modern industry, finance, and government systems open the door for a meritocracy of relatively young princes whereas before extreme age and the connections that came with would have been an insurmountable advantage.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think in V5 it was more, &quot;A shit ton of Elders died and that finally made some room at the top.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T05:09:55-07:00","id":1523345,"title":"","content":"Being the huge aficionado that I am, here's my favorites:<br /> <br /> <u>Updated</u><br /> <br /> 1. <b>Kevin Jackson</b>: For the same reasons listed above.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>Damien</b>: Him becoming a Brujah sellout like Balthazar is a great twist on the character.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Allicia</b>: We get a lot of new information on her and she's now a Anarch herself.<br /> <br /> 4. <b>Evelyn</b>: I like how, like Anita Wainwright, she's become a genuine Brujah leader. Sadly, that will never work out.<br /> <br /> 5. <b>Theo Bell</b>: I really like the idea that Theo Bell assassinated Hardlestadt and went full Anarch. He's still a moderate Anarch voice, though.<br /> <br /> <u>Original</u><br /> <br /> 1. <b>Flyboy</b>: The Thin Blood traitor who has made himself incredibly rich and corrupt in the process.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>Sharpe</b>: Maxwell's right hand man is the perfect sort of Ventrue trying to make it big via combat versus business.<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Arthur Caldwell</b>: I'm biased here because he was a NPC from my table. But I just love how much of a in-universe PC he is and how that is a TERRIBLE attitude to have.<br /> <br /> 4. <b>The Operator</b>: I just love Kindred assassins.<br /> <br /> 5. <b>Victor Temple</b>: The Undisputed Baron of the Valley.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T11:18:20-07:00","id":1523360,"title":"","content":"Because I was in a time crunch yesterday I didn't list another two characters that drew my attention.<br /> <br /> Elieser De Polanco: The idea of this Lasombra being part of a family that was closely watched and would embrace the best members of that line got me intrigued if other clans like the Ventrue, Tremere and even the Followers Of Set might have done the same thing. I also liked tat he was quiet, skilled, and natural leader that gained a appreciation for Moorish works of art and science. He was a better warrior/poet then the Brujah claim to be.<br /> <br /> Ambrogino Giovanni: A Giovanni/Hecate elder that didn't let the fact that he was a ilegitmate son of Augustus Giovanni and was probably looked down by other members of his family didn't stop him from being embraced by Lady Constancia and reached a mastery of necromantic power that few could dream of and was willing to work with Lazarus to reach it. I'm betting that it wasn't hard to convince to go along with The Last Supper Ritual that saw the end of Augustus for good.<br /> <br /> Funny how that a handful of npcs that I liked are members of the Lasombra &amp; Giovanni clans and I normally don't choose them for a player character as I'm drawn to Brujah, Gangrel, Followers of Set &amp; the Malkavians clans and a soft spot for the Nagaraja bloodline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 09-30-2023, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T11:24:58-07:00","id":1523361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523298-favorite-5th-edition-npcs?p=1523339#post1523339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think in V5 it was more, &quot;A shit ton of Elders died and that finally made some room at the top.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you Second Inquistion &amp; The Beckoning that is giving more room for younger characters a chance to gain some promience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}